# Keep the Docker build context small and reproducible.
# The Web UI is built inside the image (webui-builder stage), so exclude any
# local node_modules and stale dist; the Go build re-embeds a fresh dist.
.git
bin/
**/node_modules
webui/dist
controlplane/internal/webui/dist
**/coverage.out
**/coverage.html
**/*.log
sdk/
docs/
.github/
# Local state / secrets that must never enter an image.
**/.env
**/bootstrap_admin_credentials.txt
deploy/
